{"id":"44af585e6fa080e5","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-ito-integral.md","title":"Itô Integral","display":"df-ito-integral — Itô Integral","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ito-integral","aliases":["58-df-ito-integral","Itô Integral"],"display":"df-ito-integral — Itô Integral","depends_on":["[[58-df-stochastic-integral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ito-integral"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ito-integral</span><span>Itô Integral</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ito-integral — Itô Integral"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"263379658f1ae518\" href=\"?note=263379658f1ae518\" title=\"58-df-stochastic-integral\">58-df-stochastic-integral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,H,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V\">\\(I,H,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ItoIntegral}_t\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\operatorname{ItoIntegral}_t\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (上游 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^2\">\\(L^2\\)</span> 极限定义, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"263379658f1ae518\" href=\"?note=263379658f1ae518\" title=\"58-df-stochastic-integral\">58-df-stochastic-integral</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> (本文件定义的显式时间兼容别名)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ito\\text{-}integral} \\vdash \\mathrm{ItoIntegral}_S(I,H,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\\leftrightarrow t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\\operatorname{ItoIntegral}_t(I,H,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ito\\text{-}integral} \\vdash \\mathrm{ItoIntegral}_S(I,H,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\\leftrightarrow t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\\operatorname{ItoIntegral}_t(I,H,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Itô integral: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^2\">\\(L^2\\)</span> limit of simple predictable left-endpoint sums, as defined upstream.</li>\n<li>Itô isometry is a theorem about the integral and is no longer conjoined to its definition.</li>\n<li>Itô vs Stratonovich: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(B_t) \\approx f(B_0) + \\int f&#39;(B_s) \\circ dB_s + (1/2)\\int f&#39;&#39;(B_s) ds\">\\(f(B_t) \\approx f(B_0) + \\int f&#39;(B_s) \\circ dB_s + (1/2)\\int f&#39;&#39;(B_s) ds\\)</span></li>\n<li>Chain rule: Itô formula gives calculus for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(B_t)\">\\(f(B_t)\\)</span>; essential for SDEs</li>\n<li>Lévy: quadratic variation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[B]_t = t\">\\([B]_t = t\\)</span> for Brownian; characterizes as martingale with QV <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Karatzas and Shreve, Brownian Motion and Stochastic Calculus</li>\n<li>Øksendal, Stochastic Differential Equations</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-stochastic-integral","status":"resolved","id":"263379658f1ae518","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-stochastic-integral]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-stochastic-integral","status":"resolved","id":"263379658f1ae518","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ItoIntegral}_t\\subseteq V^7$ (上游 $L^2$ 极限定义, see [[58-df-stochastic-integral]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,H,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ItoIntegral}_t\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"L^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}_S\\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ito\\text{-}integral} \\vdash \\mathrm{ItoIntegral}_S(I,H,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\\leftrightarrow t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\\operatorname{ItoIntegral}_t(I,H,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)","display":true},{"tex":"L^2","display":false},{"tex":"f(B_t) \\approx f(B_0) + \\int f'(B_s) \\circ dB_s + (1/2)\\int f''(B_s) ds","display":false},{"tex":"f(B_t)","display":false},{"tex":"[B]_t = t","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false}],"bytes":1410,"backlinks":[{"id":"c9068a8f2385d816","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}$ 取 [[../batch18/58-df-ito-integral.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"c462e4cd1ccada77","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}$ 取 [[58-df-ito-integral]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-711","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-ito-integral.md|58-df-ito-integral]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["263379658f1ae518"]}